  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "租稅原理",
    "sub_ename": "PRINCIPLES OF TAXATION",
    "describe_ch": "探討何謂租稅、為何必須納稅、租稅之目的、租稅之分類、租稅制度之沿革、近代租稅思想之發展、稅源之問題、租稅客體與納稅主體、免稅特權與物的非課稅、課稅標準、各種扣除、稅率、租稅轉嫁及租稅理論之新發展，使學生瞭解租稅課徵原理、思想及歷史，以奠定學習相關租稅課程之基礎。",
    "describe_eh": "This course provides an introduction of fundamental principles of taxation. Help students to understand taxation theory and tax law. The objective of this course is to teach students to recognize the major tax issues inherent in business and financial transactions. The course focuses on fundamental concepts, the mastery of which topics.",
